            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "Before the new one: say the Marathi for art, then the Marathi for a team."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "index": 1,
          "type": "input",
          "title": "You'll want to know: प्रयत्न करणे",
          "segments": [
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "प्रयत्न करणे — prayatna karṇe — \"to try\"."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "index": 2,
          "type": "etymology",
          "title": "The word, taken apart",
          "segments": [
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "प्रयत्न is Sanskrit prayatna, \"effort\", a tatsama. करणे comes from Sanskrit karoti, \"does\" (CDIAL 2814)."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "index": 3,
          "type": "notice",
